ios-redfin Turnip patch 0116: after UniXNU/UniXNU 2d0d39f + 6c295f4 (patches/mesa/turnip-transient-attachments-in-gmem.patch, bluseliu50),
re-done on Mesa 85fda3b + UniXNU e95b37d patches + ours 0100-0115 (their version sits on five later UniXNU mesa patches; their
darwin_sparse_vma_init/lazy BO from their newer darwin KMD). Knob SWEET_TU_TRANSIENT=1 (unset/0: no lazy memory type, TU_DEBUG=sysmem
returns early as before). a6xx and a7xx alike (no chip-specific path). 93ad2ce not taken: it fixes their gmem-mutable-swap patch.

